CC : CCE , SINWSG , SINWOG , BBS/O , BBS , BBO , Others Listed .

Good Day

Enclosed latest update on Draft Cut Situation In Kolkata Port .


  *   Outward draft for CCU fm 14-Nov-13 till 20-Nov-2013 will avrg. at 6.0 mtrs sub to changes.
  *   Outward draft for HAL fm 14-Nov-13 till 20-Nov-2013 will avrg. at 6.2 mtrs sub to changes.
  *   Draft cut announced for CCU by 0.3 mtrs to 0.5 mtrs. on day-to-day basis till 21-Nov-2013.
  *   As per Marine dept. Circular no. MRN/HMR/99/17, NO draft cut at Haldia till 23-Nov-2013.
  *   Situation was aggravated by govt. Dams like DVC releasing abt half-a-million cusecs of water during recent cyclonic foramtions at Orissa & Andhra Pradesh Distr.
  *   Beside DVC, Galudi barrage at Jharkhand & kansabati barrage at West Bengal also released water causing floods in certain areas resuling in sludge & mud fomations in the navigational channels.
  *   However, situation has improved over three days with avlbl outward draft increasing gradually fm 5.4 mtrs to 5.8 mtrs. for vsls abv 9 kts & abv.
  *   Presently 2 CHS vsls are working at berth & expected to sail tomorrow evening. Further 2 CHS vsls scheduled to arrive for berthing over weekend.
  *   Currently, space is allotted by CHS partners as per BSA quota to HJS. However, additional space / tonnage is difficult to obtain until draft normalcy.
  *   NSD Lock Gates are operational .
  *   O/B allocation is being done on restricted basis , due to shortage of space on CHS feeder Vessels .
  *   On Winter Surcharge , no official announcements made by any Shipping Lines ( few major carriers viz Maersk/MSC/APL/NYK/EMC/YML/Happag will not apply for this temporary draft cut ) .
  *   As per WSI Guideline Hjs has announced Winter Surcharge for INHDA , for INCCU O/B is being accepted subject to CMPB Guideline of Usd 350/teu .
  *   Effective 1/11/2013 , full R/R has been announced for NE/ME basis WSE guideline .
  *   Situation likely to be normal in Wk 48 .





Regards

Gaurav Sengupa

CCUBSG .



