good day



ref our discussion in tele conference , pls note we have indicated in our message dtd 25/10/2013 ( 1st update ) regarding Surcharge by feeder operators ( due to draft cut in kolkata port ) .

in this connection till date no shipping line have made any official announcements to implement any such surcharge  . We have spoken to other carriers and major shippers who indicated that , it is still under negotiation and yet to be finalised and announced . Meantime KOPT has called a meeting with the feeder operator association to discuss , why such surcharge should be announced for a temporary draft cut in river hooghly ( likely to continue till 10/11/2013 ) . Undersatnd EISA ( EASTERN INDIA SHIPPERS ASSOCIATION ) is likely to be present in the meeting .



Hjs action plan :

- closely monitoring the surcharge developments .

- wait and watch policy for other shipping lines .

- CHS negotiation is controlled by WSG ( however we will give regular updates to BOMBB )

