good day

further to updatres from BSO , kindly note I had a discussion with kopt marine desk ( DDMS ) and the TM .
understand the draft cut of 0.9Min Hooghly river is likely to continue till the 10th Nov 2013 . They advised this is a common phenomenon in the river mouth of a riverine port ( ofcourse last year the draft cut during this period was only 0.3 M ) .
Impact of draft cut .
- drop in CHS space in O/B CHS loaders .
- O/B liftings to drop .
- shut out of O/B units .
- vsl diversion to budge budge and haldia .
- delay in I/B arrivals .

Will be meeting the port officials once agin on Monday the 28th of Nov 2013 , and shall further revert with updates  .

